{"id":"8e343b0f4eb4c083","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-priority-method.md","title":"Priority Method","display":"df-priority-method — Priority Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-priority-method","aliases":["88-df-priority-method"],"display":"df-priority-method — Priority Method","depends_on":["[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-priority-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-priority-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-priority-method — Priority Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件形式化一个具体的 <strong>c.e. 有限损伤优先构造框架</strong>：较小的要求编号有较高优先级，每阶段至多一个策略行动，行动后初始化所有较低优先级策略。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=(R_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(R=(R_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span> 是语义要求序列；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n\">\\(R_n\\)</span> 是满足该要求的最终自然数集合所成的类（它本身是集合）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为阶段输出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)\\)</span> 均由本文件定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是损伤关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin}(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin}(c)\\)</span> 是下述二进制有限集解码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor\\cdot\\rfloor\">\\(\\lfloor\\cdot\\rfloor\\)</span> 为通常的整数下取整。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\)</span> 为构造数据：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(s)\">\\(a(s)\\)</span> 编码输出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(s)=0\">\\(p(s)=0\\)</span> 表示无行动，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(s)=n+1\">\\(p(s)=n+1\\)</span> 表示要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 行动；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n,s)\">\\(q(n,s)\\)</span> 表示需要注意；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(n,s)\">\\(r(n,s)\\)</span> 为保护界，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(n,s)\">\\(b(n,s)\\)</span> 为局部状态码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；它们的可计算性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_1,\\mathrm{Comp}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_1,\\mathrm{Comp}_2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D\">\\(a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D\\)</span> 是下述元组投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\">\\(\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_D\">\\(I_D\\)</span> 是本文件定义的合法运行数据与诱导损伤关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fin}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\leq c\\land\n\\lfloor c/2^n\\rfloor-2\\lfloor c/2^{n+1}\\rfloor=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fin}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\leq c\\land\n\\lfloor c/2^n\\rfloor-2\\lfloor c/2^{n+1}\\rfloor=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\to\n\\langle a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D\\rangle=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\to\n\\langle a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D\\rangle=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land A\\in Q.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land A\\in Q.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\land (A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(a)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(q)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(b)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land A_0=\\emptyset\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(A_s=\\mathrm{Fin}(a(s))\\land A_s\\subseteq A_{s+1})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(r(n,0)=0\\land b(n,0)=0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(p(s)=0\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\leq s\\;q(n,s)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\leftrightarrow\nm\\leq s\\land q(m,s)=1\\land\\forall n&lt;m\\;q(n,s)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land(p(s)=0\\to A_{s+1}=A_s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\to\n\\forall n&lt;m\\;\\forall x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\;x\\geq r(n,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n0&lt;p(s)\\leq n\\to b(n,s+1)=0\\land r(n,s+1)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\np(s)=0\\lor n+1&lt;p(s)\\to\nb(n,s+1)=b(n,s)\\land r(n,s+1)=r(n,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\land (A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(a)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(q)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(b)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land A_0=\\emptyset\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(A_s=\\mathrm{Fin}(a(s))\\land A_s\\subseteq A_{s+1})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(r(n,0)=0\\land b(n,0)=0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(p(s)=0\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\leq s\\;q(n,s)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\leftrightarrow\nm\\leq s\\land q(m,s)=1\\land\\forall n&lt;m\\;q(n,s)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land(p(s)=0\\to A_{s+1}=A_s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\to\n\\forall n&lt;m\\;\\forall x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\;x\\geq r(n,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n0&lt;p(s)\\leq n\\to b(n,s+1)=0\\land r(n,s+1)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\np(s)=0\\lor n+1&lt;p(s)\\to\nb(n,s+1)=b(n,s)\\land r(n,s+1)=r(n,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nI_D\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,s\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;(D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\n\\land p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land0&lt;p(s)\\leq n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nI_D\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,s\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;(D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\n\\land p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land0&lt;p(s)\\leq n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\land I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\langle n,s\\rangle\\notin I,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D\\;(\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\land I=I_D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\land I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\langle n,s\\rangle\\notin I,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists D\\;(\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\land I=I_D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有阶段输出都由一个总可计算的数值编码函数给出，有限集单调增加。注意选择规则是“编号最小且当前需要注意的策略”；低优先级枚举不得破坏高优先级保护界；高优先级行动对低优先级的初始化及其损伤时刻均有明确公式。局部状态码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 表示初始化状态。具体构造必须给出可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,r,b,a\">\\(q,r,b,a\\)</span>，不能只写一句“有优先策略”。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n\">\\(R_n\\)</span> 可以描述最终集合的非可判定性质；不要求能在有限阶段判定最终要求是否满足。成功条件在极限输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_s A_s\">\\(\\bigcup_s A_s\\)</span> 上检验，<strong>不</strong>把“所有足够晚的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 满足要求”错误地当作最终满足。有限损伤本身只限制初始化次数，不能推出所有要求成功；验证这些局部义务的一个精确引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"865c7ff37947029a\" href=\"?note=865c7ff37947029a\" title=\"88-lem-finite-injury-verification\">88-lem-finite-injury-verification</a>。</p>\n<p>这是有明确数据和规则的有限损伤模式，不声称覆盖无限损伤、优先树等所有变体。有限损伤中未使用的语义参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 只限定要求序列的类型，不充当损伤次数的循环定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$；它们的可计算性使用 [[88-df-computable-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{Comp}_1,\\mathrm{Comp}_2$。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-finite-injury-verification","status":"resolved","id":"865c7ff37947029a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$R_n$ 可以描述最终集合的非可判定性质；不要求能在有限阶段判定最终要求是否满足。成功条件在极限输出 $\\bigcup_s A_s$ 上检验，**不**把“所有足够晚的有限 $A_s$ 满足要求”错误地当作最终满足。有限损伤本身只限制初始化次数，不能推出所有要求成功；验证这些局部义务的一个精确引理见 [[88-lem-finite-injury-verification]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R=(R_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))","display":false},{"tex":"R_n","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fin}(c)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\lfloor\\cdot\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a(s)","display":false},{"tex":"p(s)=0","display":false},{"tex":"p(s)=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"q(n,s)","display":false},{"tex":"r(n,s)","display":false},{"tex":"b(n,s)","display":false},{"tex":"a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_1,\\mathrm{Comp}_2","display":false},{"tex":"a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))","display":false},{"tex":"I_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fin}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\leq c\\land\n\\lfloor c/2^n\\rfloor-2\\lfloor c/2^{n+1}\\rfloor=1\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\to\n\\langle a_D,p_D,q_D,r_D,b_D\\rangle=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(Q,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nQ\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land A\\in Q.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;\\Bigl(&\nD=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\\land (A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&{}\\land a,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land r,b:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(a)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(q)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(r)\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(b)\\\\\n&{}\\land A_0=\\emptyset\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(A_s=\\mathrm{Fin}(a(s))\\land A_s\\subseteq A_{s+1})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(r(n,0)=0\\land b(n,0)=0)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(p(s)=0\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\leq s\\;q(n,s)=0)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\leftrightarrow\nm\\leq s\\land q(m,s)=1\\land\\forall n<m\\;q(n,s)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land(p(s)=0\\to A_{s+1}=A_s)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(s)=m+1\\to\n\\forall n<m\\;\\forall x\\in A_{s+1}\\setminus A_s\\;x\\geq r(n,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n0<p(s)\\leq n\\to b(n,s+1)=0\\land r(n,s+1)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\np(s)=0\\lor n+1<p(s)\\to\nb(n,s+1)=b(n,s)\\land r(n,s+1)=r(n,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\nI_D\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,s\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists a,p,q,r,b\\;(D=\\langle a,p,q,r,b\\rangle\n\\land p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land0<p(s)\\leq n)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nR:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\land I\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall s\\geq s_0\\;\\langle n,s\\rangle\\notin I,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists D\\;(\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))\\land I=I_D)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{Satisfied}(R_n,\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}A_s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"q,r,b,a","display":false},{"tex":"R_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_s A_s","display":false},{"tex":"A_s","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":5205,"backlinks":[{"id":"865c7ff37947029a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$、$(A_s)$、$D$、$p_D$、$I_D$、$\\mathrm{PriorityData}$、$\\mathrm{Satisfied}$、$\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}$ 见 [[88-df-priority-method]]。"},{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限损伤运行与验证义务分别见 [[88-df-priority-method]]、[[